{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261125/photo/bkn-20261125195500770-1125_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261125215708\"/><p>事主由貴園樓一走廊墮下。</p><p>今午(25日)4時14分，執法部門收到黃大仙竹園南邨的保安員報案，指一名男子倒臥於貴園樓對開。救援人員接報到場，將陷入昏迷的姓陳(26歲)內地事主送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。經初步調查，警員相信事主從上址走廊墮下，現場沒有檢獲遺書，其墮樓原因有待進一步了解。案件列作「有人從高處墮下」跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T14:24:02.477870+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T11:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T14:17:22.729124+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T14:17:22.729124+00:00","content_hash":"bf3be52682ad289fa6aea74d2b3cf68c593d14c5b835bf49f13f2394647e47ec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}